          "Content": [
            {
              "id": 30,
              "Title": "How to Order",
              "Text": "Ordering delicious meals and refreshing beverages directly to your room has never been easier! Follow these simple steps:\n\n\n\n#### **Using the App:**\n1. Browse our enticing menus and select the items you'd like to enjoy.\n2. Add your choices to the checkout basket.\n3. Enter your details and click \"Confirm Order.\"\n4. Await a quick confirmation call from our friendly staff.\n\n\n\n#### **Delivery Hours:**\nFood & Snacks: 1:00 PM – 11:00 PM\n\nBar & Beverages: 4:00 PM – 2:00 AM\n\n\n\n#### **Payment:**\nYour selected payment card will be charged upon confirming your order.\n\n\n\n#### **Prefer Ordering by Phone?**\nSimply **dial 0** on your room telephone, and our staff will gladly assist you.\n\n\n**Enjoy your stay and bon appétit!**",
